      ],
      "text": "PATHO:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " Pancreatic fatigue → hyperglycemia → polyuria → dehydration → plasma contraction → renal failure/COMA!! They don’t have time to make taurine molecules like in DKA, so cerebral edema is not a initial concern. They are severely fluid depleted. "
     }
    ]
