      ],
      "text": "HX/PE:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " polyuria, polydipsia, polyphagia, weakness, NV, confusion, dehydration, normal breathing (compared to DKA), tachycardia, dry mucous membranes, fluid deficit."
